{"module":"/assets/explain/method/method-discriminant.js","part":"figure","scope":"method-discriminant","title":"抛物线与横轴的三种位置：开口方向加判别式","note":"二次式对全体实数 $x$ 恒成立、且二次项系数确定非零时使用。开口向上要 $f(x)\\ge0$，图像不能到横轴下方，即 $\\Delta\\le0$；不带等号时只取 $\\Delta<0$。","after":"conditions","version":"5a33896b7398","html":"<div class=\"method-figure\">\n      <ul class=\"method-graphs\" aria-label=\"开口向上时，抛物线与横轴的三种位置\">\n        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 84\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line class=\"g-axis\" x1=\"6\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"60\"/><path class=\"g-curve\" d=\"M14 8 Q60 92 106 8\"/></svg><b>Δ &lt; 0</b><span>不相交 <span class=\"ok-mark\">✓</span></span></li>\n        <li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 84\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line class=\"g-axis\" x1=\"6\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"60\"/><path class=\"g-curve\" d=\"M14 8 Q60 112 106 8\"/><circle class=\"g-dot\" cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"3.6\"/></svg><b>Δ = 0</b><span>相切，允许取等时 <span class=\"ok-mark\">✓</span></span></li>\n        <li class=\"bad\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 84\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line class=\"g-axis\" x1=\"6\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"60\"/><line class=\"g-bad\" x1=\"37.7\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"82.3\" y2=\"60\"/><path class=\"g-curve\" d=\"M14 8 Q60 144 106 8\"/></svg><b>Δ &gt; 0</b><span>穿过横轴 <span class=\"bad-mark\">✗</span></span></li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"method-graph-caption\">开口向上时，要 <math><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math> 恒成立，图像不能到横轴下方</p>\n      <ul class=\"method-cases\">\n        <li><span class=\"method-case-tag\">恒 ≥ 0</span><span>开口向上</span><span class=\"method-case-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><span>Δ ≤ 0</span></li>\n        <li><span class=\"method-case-tag\">恒 ≤ 0</span><span>开口向下</span><span class=\"method-case-arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span><span>Δ ≤ 0</span></li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"method-pill\">不等号不带等号（&gt;、&lt;）时，只取 Δ &lt; 0</p>\n    </div>"}
